# The guide pop-up (design/data/guide.toml → life/guide.js → ttl-portals /ttlguide) and the Voice of the World
# NPC in the Spirit Corridor (life/voice_npc.js). Bots have no client, so /ttlguide records the set it would have
# shown and `ttlguide check <bot> <set>` prints "ttl: ..." when that was not the last one.
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] TtlBotGuide died in Life 1", "[ttl] TtlBotGuide reborn as slime".
ttlbot spawn TtlBotGuide
@sleep 2
ttl reset TtlBotGuide
ttl guideforget TtlBotGuide
# The NPC stands in the hall (summoned again within 30 s if it goes missing).
ttl npc
# /ttl guide for players, and the NPC's right-click (/ttl talk) outside the Corridor: the main guide.
execute as TtlBotGuide run ttl guide life2
ttlguide check TtlBotGuide life2
execute as TtlBotGuide run ttl talk
ttlguide check TtlBotGuide main
# A raw /ttlguide with its own pages.
ttlguide TtlBotGuide {"set":"rcon","then":"ttl life","pages":[{"title":"Test","lines":["# Heading","- a `command`","*gold*"]},{"title":"Two","body":"line 1\nline 2"}]}
ttlguide check TtlBotGuide rcon
# First death: after the Voice lines (8 s) the short Corridor guide comes instead of the Life screen.
kill TtlBotGuide
@sleep 10
ttl karma TtlBotGuide expect phase corridor
ttlguide check TtlBotGuide corridor
# The NPC in the Corridor reopens the current step (the Last Wish menu) and shows no guide.
execute as TtlBotGuide run ttl talk
ttlguide check TtlBotGuide corridor
ttl karma TtlBotGuide expect step wish
# Rebirth (a Wanderer gets a random unique and is reborn at once): the Life 2 guide follows.
execute as TtlBotGuide run ttl wish knowledge
execute as TtlBotGuide run ttl choose slime
ttl karma TtlBotGuide expect phase life2
@sleep 8
ttlguide check TtlBotGuide life2
# Outside the Corridor the NPC shows the main guide again.
execute as TtlBotGuide run ttl talk
ttlguide check TtlBotGuide main
# Once only: a second Life 1 death skips the Corridor guide (the Life screen opens directly).
ttl reset TtlBotGuide
kill TtlBotGuide
@sleep 10
ttl karma TtlBotGuide expect step wish
ttlguide check TtlBotGuide main
ttl reset TtlBotGuide
ttlbot remove TtlBotGuide
